---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Pricing - urfired.lol"
  description="Choose the perfect plan for your firing needs. From casual terminations to mass layoffs."
>
  <div class="pricing-container">
    <div class="pricing-content">
      <header class="pricing-header">
        <h1>Pricing Plans</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Choose your termination frequency (it's all free, we're not monsters)</p>
      </header>

      <div class="pricing-cards">
        <!-- Basic Plan -->
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3 class="plan-name">Basic</h3>
            <div class="price">
              <span class="currency">$</span>
              <span class="amount">0</span>
              <span class="period">/month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="plan-tagline">For the casually unemployed</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-body">
            <ul class="features">
              <li>✨ Up to <strong>10 firings</strong> per month</li>
              <li>🎲 Random firing reasons</li>
              <li>🔗 Custom URL parameters (n & c)</li>
              <li>📱 Mobile & desktop support</li>
              <li>😢 Unlimited tears (not included)</li>
              <li>📦 Zero severance package</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <button class="cta-button basic" data-plan="basic">
              Get Fired (Responsibly)
            </button>
            <p class="disclaimer">* for educational purposes only</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Layoff Plan (Most Popular) -->
        <div class="pricing-card featured">
          <div class="badge">HR's Choice</div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3 class="plan-name">Layoff</h3>
            <div class="price">
              <span class="currency">$</span>
              <span class="amount">99.99</span>
              <span class="period">/month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="plan-tagline">Your severance package at work</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-body">
            <ul class="features">
              <li>🚀 Up to <strong>16,000 layoffs</strong> per day</li>
              <li>⚡ Priority firing queue</li>
              <li>🎯 Personalized termination messages</li>
              <li>📊 Layoff analytics dashboard*</li>
              <li>💼 Virtual exit interview</li>
              <li>🎁 Complimentary "It's not you, it's us" card</li>
              <li>☕ Coffee machine access (for 2 more weeks)</li>
              <li>📧 Mass firing email templates</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <button class="cta-button layoff" data-plan="layoff">
              Mass Termination Mode
            </button>
            <p class="disclaimer">* analytics show only despair</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Enterprise Plan -->
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h3 class="plan-name">Enterprise</h3>
            <div class="price">
              <span class="currency">$</span>
              <span class="amount">???</span>
              <span class="period">/month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="plan-tagline">When layoffs become a lifestyle</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="enterprise-message">
              <p class="big-text">Really? 🤔</p>
              <p class="message-text">
                You need <strong>MORE</strong> than 16,000 layoffs per day? 
              </p>
              <p class="message-text">
                Ok, we're not here to judge... but we're totally judging you 👀
              </p>
              <p class="message-text final">
                Let's get in touch and discuss your... <em>unique</em> situation.
              </p>
            </div>

            <ul class="features">
              <li>♾️ <strong>Unlimited</strong> firings (oof)</li>
              <li>🏢 Dedicated account manager</li>
              <li>🎭 Custom firing reasons</li>
              <li>🔐 Private firing portal</li>
              <li>📞 24/7 termination support</li>
              <li>🎪 On-site layoff ceremonies</li>
              <li>🏆 "Employer of the Year" trophy (satirical)</li>
              <li>💳 Corporate expense account tears</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <button class="cta-button enterprise" data-plan="enterprise">
              Let's Talk (About Your Addiction)
            </button>
            <p class="disclaimer">** seriously though, take a break</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-section">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4>Is this actually real?</h4>
          <p>No. This is satire. Everything is free. We're just making fun of corporate layoff culture.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4>Do I need to pay?</h4>
          <p>Absolutely not. The only thing you're paying is attention to how absurd layoff season has become.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4>Can I actually get 16,000 firings per day?</h4>
          <p>You can click as many times as you want. We won't stop you. But maybe... consider therapy?</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="pricing-footer">
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">← Home</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="/docs">Documentation</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/yorjaggy/urfired.lol" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="https://ko-fi.com/yorjaggy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">☕ Ko-fi</a>
        </nav>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="modal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <span class="close-button">&times;</span>
      <h3 id="modal-title">Surprise!</h3>
      <p id="modal-message">This is satire. Everything is free. Go fire yourself for free on the homepage! 😄</p>
      <button class="modal-cta" id="modal-close">Got it!</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
  const modalTitle = document.getElementById('modal-title');
  const modalMessage = document.getElementById('modal-message');
  const closeButton = document.querySelector('.close-button');
  const modalClose = document.getElementById('modal-close');
  const ctaButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.cta-button');

  const messages = {
    basic: {
      title: "Basic Plan Selected! 🎉",
      message: "Just kidding! Everything is completely free. Visit the homepage and fire yourself as many times as you want. No limits. No payments. Just vibes."
    },
    layoff: {
      title: "Mass Termination Mode Activated! 🚀",
      message: "Psych! This is satire. You can use urfired.lol unlimited times for free. Go ahead, fire everyone (virtually, of course)."
    },
    enterprise: {
      title: "Seeking Help... 😅",
      message: "We're genuinely concerned about your firing addiction. But since this is all fake anyway, go wild on the homepage. It's free forever!"
    }
  };

  ctaButtons.forEach(button => {
    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const plan = button.dataset.plan;
      const msg = messages[plan];
      modalTitle.textContent = msg.title;
      modalMessage.textContent = msg.message;
      modal.classList.add('show');
    });
  });

  closeButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
    modal.classList.remove('show');
  });

  modalClose.addEventListener('click', () => {
    modal.classList.remove('show');
  });

  window.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    if (e.target === modal) {
      modal.classList.remove('show');
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .pricing-container {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5722 0%, #E64A19 100%);
    padding: 48px 16px;
  }

  .pricing-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .pricing-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .pricing-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .pricing-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .pricing-card.featured {
    border: 3px solid #FF5722;
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .pricing-card.featured:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-8px);
  }

  .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    right: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5722, #E64A19);
    color: white;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.4);
  }

  .card-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
  }

  .plan-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .currency {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FF5722;
    margin-right: 4px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .amount {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #000;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .period {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #666;
    align-self: flex-end;
    margin-left: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .plan-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .card-body {
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .enterprise-message {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3e0, #ffe0b2);
    border-left: 4px solid #FF5722;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .big-text {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .message-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .message-text.final {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FF5722;
  }

  .features {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .features li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f5f5f5;
  }

  .features li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .features strong {
    color: #FF5722;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .card-footer {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-button {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .cta-button.basic {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #757575, #616161);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-button.basic:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #616161, #424242);
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .cta-button.layoff {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5722, #E64A19);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.3);
  }

  .cta-button.layoff:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E64A19, #D84315);
    transform: scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.4);
  }

  .cta-button.enterprise {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #000, #424242);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-button.enterprise:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #424242, #000);
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .disclaimer {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #999;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .faq-section {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .faq-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .faq-item h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FF5722;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
  }

  .pricing-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 0;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .separator {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  /* Modal */
  .modal {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 1000;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .modal.show {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .modal-content {
    background-color: white;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 16px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  @keyframes slideIn {
    from {
      transform: translateY(-50px);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      transform: translateY(0);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .close-button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 20px;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #aaa;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .close-button:hover {
    color: #000;
  }

  .modal-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .modal-content p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .modal-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5722, #E64A19);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .modal-cta:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E64A19, #D84315);
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pricing-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .pricing-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .pricing-card.featured {
      transform: scale(1);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
    }

    .faq-section {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .pricing-container {
      padding: 24px 8px;
    }

    .pricing-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .amount {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .modal-content {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
